  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO Somalia Network RDEL budget will channel &#xa3;250,000 in funding across FY23/24 and FY24/25 through the Global Mine Action Programme (GMAP3) to provide HALO with funding to support Weapons and Ammunition Management (WAM) and Explosive Ordnance Disposal (EOD) in Somaliland.</narrative>
  </description>
